:: Prison Kylar Intro
<<effects>>
<<unset $kylarReunionScene>>

Kylar stares at you until a guard shoves <<him>> from behind. <<He>> stumbles forward before <<veteran_guard 2>> marches <<him>> the rest of the way to <<his>> cell.
<br><br>

<<methodical_guard 1 cap>> snaps the ledger shut and turns back to the other prisoners. A tall gate opens at the far end of the hall, and the line starts moving towards it.
<br><br>

<<link [[Next|Prison Kylar Intro 2]]>><<endevent>><<npc Kylar>><<person1>><</link>>
<br>

:: Prison Kylar Intro 2
<<effects>>

Kylar runs from <<his>> cell as soon as the door opens, taking the stairs two at a time to reach the walkway. <<He>> spots you and hurries over.
<br><br>

<<He>> stops a few feet away and grabs the railing to steady <<himself>>. <<His>> mouth falls open as <<he>> stares at you.
<br><br>

"I-is that really you?" <<he>> asks. "A-am I seeing things again?"
<br><br>

<<link [[Apologise|Prison Kylar Intro Apologise]]>><<npcincr Kylar rage -50>><<prison_inmates -1>><</link>><<lllksuspicion>><<lrespect>>
<br>
<<link [[Be polite|Prison Kylar Intro Polite]]>><<npcincr Kylar rage -10>><</link>><<llksuspicion>>
<br>
<<link [[Dismiss|Prison Kylar Intro Dismiss]]>><<npcincr Kylar rage 30>><<prison_inmates 1>><</link>><<gggksuspicion>><<grespect>>
<br>

:: Prison Kylar Intro Apologise
<<effects>>
<<speechresolve>>

<<if $worn.face.type.includes("gag")>>
	You lower your head and try to apologise through the gag, though the words come out muffled. Kylar watches your face, then nods.
	<br><br>
<<else>>
	<<if _speechAttitudeResolved is "shy">>
		"S-sorry," you say, glancing down. "I didn't mean for you to get arrested."
	<<elseif _speechAttitudeResolved is "meek">>
		"I-I'm sorry," you say. "I didn't want you to get arrested."
	<<elseif _speechAttitudeResolved is "docile">>
		"I'm sorry," you say, lowering your head. "I didn't want you to end up in here."
	<<elseif (_speechAttitudeResolved is "polite" or _speechAttitudeResolved is "flamboyant")>>
		"I'm sorry you ended up in here," you say. "I never meant for that to happen."
	<<elseif _speechAttitudeResolved is "confident">>
		"I'm sorry you got dragged into this," you say. "That wasn't what I wanted."
	<<elseif (_speechAttitudeResolved is "bratty" or _speechAttitudeResolved is "cruel")>>
		"Sorry you ended up in here," you say. "I wasn't trying to get you arrested."
	<<else>>
		"I'm sorry you ended up in here," you say.
	<</if>>
	<br><br>
<</if>>

Kylar drops to <<his>> knees and bows <<his>> head. A few inmates turn to look as <<he>> speaks. "I-it was a mistake," <<he>> says. "I've gone over it in my head, over and over. The cake, the a-arrest. A misunderstanding."
<br><br>

<<He>> looks up and wraps <<his>> arms around your knees. "I'll look after you. I'll get you things. Just give me time." <<He>> gets back to <<his>> feet, then hurries away along the walkway.
<br><br>

<<link [[Next|Prison Walkway]]>><<endevent>><<set $prison.hours_worked to 0>><</link>>
<br>

:: Prison Kylar Intro Polite
<<effects>>
<<speechresolve>>

<<if $worn.face.type.includes("gag")>>
	You can't speak through the gag, so you give Kylar a small nod before walking past <<him>>.
<<else>>
	<<if _speechAttitudeResolved is "shy">>
		"I-I'm glad you're here," you say. "It's nice seeing someone I know."
	<<elseif _speechAttitudeResolved is "meek">>
		"I-It's good to see a familiar face," you say.
	<<elseif _speechAttitudeResolved is "docile">>
		"I'm glad you're here," you say. "I feel better with someone I know around."
	<<elseif (_speechAttitudeResolved is "polite" or _speechAttitudeResolved is "flamboyant")>>
		"It's good to see you again," you say. "I'm glad I know someone in here."
	<<elseif _speechAttitudeResolved is "confident">>
		"Good to see you," you say. "At least I know someone in here."
	<<elseif (_speechAttitudeResolved is "bratty" or _speechAttitudeResolved is "cruel")>>
		"Thank fuck I'm not alone in here," you say.
	<<else>>
		"I'm glad to see you," you say. "It's good to have someone familiar around."
	<</if>>
	<br><br>
	Kylar nods with enthusiasm. "Y-yes," <<he>> says. "I'll look out for you. I'll get you things. Just give me time." <<He>> turns and rushes along the walkway.
<</if>>
<br><br>

<<link [[Next|Prison Walkway]]>><<endevent>><<set $prison.hours_worked to 0>><</link>>
<br>

:: Prison Kylar Intro Dismiss
<<effects>>
<<speechresolve>>

<<if $worn.face.type.includes("gag")>>
	You can't speak with this gag in the way, so you stick your nose in the air and walk by Kylar without giving <<him>> another look. You think that got the point across.
<<else>>
	<<if _speechAttitudeResolved is "shy">>
		"P-please don't follow me," you say, looking away. "I want to be alone."
	<<elseif _speechAttitudeResolved is "meek">>
		"Pl-please stay away from me," you say. "I don't need you."
	<<elseif _speechAttitudeResolved is "docile">>
		"Please leave me alone," you say quietly. "I don't want your help."
	<<elseif (_speechAttitudeResolved is "polite" or _speechAttitudeResolved is "flamboyant")>>
		"Please leave me alone," you say. "I don't want your help."
	<<elseif _speechAttitudeResolved is "confident">>
		"Stay away from me," you say. "I can handle myself."
	<<elseif (_speechAttitudeResolved is "bratty" or _speechAttitudeResolved is "cruel")>>
		"You're the last thing I need," you say. "Stay the fuck away from me."
	<<else>>
		"I don't need you," you say, walking by. "Please leave me alone."
	<</if>>
	You walk past <<him>> and head for the stairs.
<</if>>
<br><br>

You look back towards your cell as you descend the stairs. Kylar is nowhere to be seen.
<br><br>

<<link [[Next|Prison Block]]>><<endevent>><<set $prison.hours_worked to 0>><</link>>
<br>

:: Prison Kylar
<<effects>>
<<npc Kylar>><<person1>>
Kylar looks up when you enter. As soon as <<he>> recognises you, <<he>> pushes <<himself>> to <<his>> feet. "I-I was hoping you'd visit," <<he>> says.
<br><br>

<<socialiseicon>><<link [[Chat (up to an hour)|Prison Kylar Chat]]>><<pass 1>><<advancetohour>><<set $prison_kylar_cell to 1>><<npcincr Kylar love 1>><<npcincr Kylar lust 5>><<npcincr Kylar rage -1>><</link>><<if C.npc.Kylar.lust gte 15>><<lllust>><<else>><<glust>><</if>><<glove>><<lksuspicion>>
