:: Prison Kylar Chat
<<effects>>

You sit with Kylar and pass the time talking.
<<rng 10>>
<<switch $rng>>
	<<case 1>>
		<<He>> tells you what <<he>> did to another inmate when <<he>> first arrived. "Th-that's why I was in solitary," <<he>> says. "When you got here."<<gstress>><<stress 6>>
	<<case 2>>
		"I've found lots of hideaways," <<he>> says. "People aren't clever about where they stash things."
	<<case 3>>
		"I avoid eye contact," <<he>> says. "People leave me alone."
	<<case 4>>
		"It's not so different from school here," <<he>> says.
	<<case 5>>
		"I dunno why people try to climb the walls," <<he>> says. "Those birds are huge."
	<<case 6>>
		"I'm surprised they don't serve fish in the canteen," <<he>> says. "Where'd they get all that food from, anyway?"
	<<case 7>>
		"There's a cupboard in medical," <<he>> says. "I wonder what's inside."
	<<case 8>>
		"That locked door in the yard must go somewhere interesting," <<he>> says.
	<<case 9>>
		"They wouldn't let me in the spire," <<he>> says. "I just wanted to explore."
	<<default>>
		"I've seen the way people look at you," <<he>> says. "Th-they won't try anything while I'm around."
<</switch>>
<br><br>

<<if C.npc.Kylar.lust gte 20>>
	<<set _rng to random(6, 12)>>
	As you stand to leave, Kylar grabs your wrist. "I-I've got something for you." <<He>> reaches into <<his>> pocket and presses a handful of shark's teeth into your palm. "H-here."
	<<prison_teeth_text _rng>><<prison_teeth _rng>><<lllust>><<npcincr Kylar lust -20>>
	<br><br>
<</if>>

<<link [[Next|Prison Block]]>><<endevent>><</link>>
<br>

:: Prison Attention Kylar
<<effects>>

<<endevent>>
<<npc Kylar>><<generate_veteran_guard 1>>
<<speechresolve>>
"Kylar!" you shout.
<<if _speechAttitudeResolved is "shy">>
	"P-please, I need help!"
<<elseif _speechAttitudeResolved is "meek">>
	"I-I need you. Please!"
<<elseif _speechAttitudeResolved is "docile">>
	"Please help me!"
<<elseif (_speechAttitudeResolved is "polite" or _speechAttitudeResolved is "flamboyant")>>
	"I need your help!"
<<elseif _speechAttitudeResolved is "confident">>
	"Give me a hand!"
<<elseif (_speechAttitudeResolved is "bratty" or _speechAttitudeResolved is "cruel")>>
	"Get over here and help me!"
<<else>>
	"Help me!"
<</if>>
<br><br>
<<set _rng to random(1, 2)>>
<<switch _rng>>
	<<case 1>>
		<<person2>><<veteran_guard 1 cap>> stomps over to a nearby vent and yanks it open, then leans in to shine <<his>> torch into the dark. <span class="green">A dart pierces <<his>> neck.</span> <<He>> rips it out and turns around. Kylar is standing in the open with a makeshift blowgun in <<person1>><<his>> hand.
		<br><br>

		Kylar turns to run, but <<veteran_guard 1>> catches <<him>> before <<he>> gets far. <<person2>><<He>> forces Kylar to the ground and pins <<him>> there as the dart's poison starts to slow <<his>> movements.
		<br><br>
	<<case 2>>
		<span class="green">A dart pierces <<veteran_guard 1>>'s neck.</span> <<person2>><<He>> spins around, searching for whoever fired it, then spots movement by a nearby vent. <<He>> stomps over, reaches inside and drags out a struggling Kylar.
		<br><br>

		<<He>> forces Kylar to the ground and pins <<him>> there as the dart's poison starts to slow <<his>> movements.
		<br><br>
	<<default>>
<</switch>>
Inmates crowd around the struggling pair while the other guards push through them. You slip away before they can turn their attention back to you.

<span class="purple">Kylar will be in solitary for a while.</span>
<br><br>

<<destination_prison>>
